{%- comment -%}
  Shared hero for the web tools. Renders the page <h1>, so a page including this
  must not also carry its own, or the document ends up with two.

  Content comes from src/_data/toolHero.json keyed by page.url. A page with no
  entry renders nothing rather than an empty band, so this is safe to include
  before its copy has been written.

  A page can set heroSubtitle before including to pass a subtitle that has to be
  rendered rather than stored, since Liquid in a JSON data value is emitted
  literally.

  Sits on the cream page background rather than carrying its own, so the doodles
  read as part of the page the way they do on the homepage and in the footer.
  Every page using this already includes sketch-styles.liquid, which is what
  positions .sketch-note and hides the doodles below 640px.

  The type is styled here rather than with Tailwind utilities on purpose.
  Tailwind v4 emits utilities inside @layer utilities, and unlayered CSS beats
  any layered rule whatever its specificity, so on a page carrying its own bare
  `h1 { font-size }` the utilities lost silently: /emoji/, /vibe-check/ and
  /word-clock/ were rendering the title at 27, 30 and 23px instead of 60. These
  rules are unlayered and two classes deep so they win on those pages and on the
  next tool with its own stylesheet. Sizes are Tailwind's own values, so this is
  the same type scale it was, just no longer overridable by accident.

  Contrast on cream #fef5ec: cocoa title 12.46:1, coral-deep eyebrow 4.68:1,
  stone-600 subtitle 7.08:1. The eyebrow is coral-deep rather than stock coral
  because coral is only 2.78:1 here and it is small text.

  Doodles are decorative and deliberately generic, since this same header runs
  across every tool. They are aria-hidden both here and again from the script in
  sketch-styles.liquid, so they stay out of the accessibility tree without JS.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign hero = toolHero[page.url] -%}
{%- if hero -%}
{%- assign heroSub = heroSubtitle | default: hero.subtitle -%}
<style>
    .tool-hero { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
    .tool-hero .tool-hero__inner {
        position: relative;
        margin-inline: auto;
        max-width: 48rem;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .tool-hero .tool-hero__eyebrow {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        line-height: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        color: #c4413a;
    }
    .tool-hero .tool-hero__title {
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
        font-size: 2.25rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        color: #3d2b1f;
    }
    .tool-hero .tool-hero__sub {
        margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
        max-width: 42rem;
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.625;
        color: #57534e;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .tool-hero { padding: 6rem 1.5rem; }
        .tool-hero .tool-hero__eyebrow { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; }
        .tool-hero .tool-hero__title { font-size: 3rem; }
        .tool-hero .tool-hero__sub { font-size: 1.25rem; }
    }
    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .tool-hero .tool-hero__title { font-size: 3.75rem; }
    }
</style>
<section class="tool-hero">
    <div class="tool-hero__inner">

        <!-- Sketch: coffee cup, top left -->
        <div class="sketch-note sketch-float-slow" aria-hidden="true" style="top: -6px; left: 1%; --sketch-rotate: -10deg; transform: rotate(-10deg);">
            <svg width="28" height="32" viewBox="0 0 28 32">
                <path d="M4 10 L4 26 C4 28 6 30 10 30 L18 30 C22 30 24 28 24 26 L24 10" class="sketch-arrow" style="opacity: 0.35;"/>
                <path d="M24 14 C28 14, 28 22, 24 22" class="sketch-arrow" style="opacity: 0.35;"/>
                <path d="M9 6 C9 2, 11 0, 11 0" class="sketch-arrow" style="opacity: 0.2;"/>
                <path d="M15 4 C15 0, 17 -2, 17 -2" class="sketch-arrow" style="opacity: 0.2;"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Sketch: sparkles, top right -->
        <div class="sketch-note" aria-hidden="true" style="top: -2px; right: 2%; transform: rotate(8deg);">
            <svg width="42" height="40" viewBox="0 0 42 40">
                <path d="M14 2 L14 18 M6 10 L22 10" class="sketch-sparkle"/>
                <path d="M31 16 L31 28 M25 22 L37 22" class="sketch-sparkle" style="opacity: 0.28;"/>
                <circle cx="9" cy="30" r="1.8" class="sketch-dots"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        {%- if hero.eyebrow %}
        <p class="tool-hero__eyebrow">{{ hero.eyebrow }}</p>
        {%- endif %}

        <h1 class="tool-hero__title">{{ hero.title }}</h1>

        {%- if heroSub %}
        <p class="tool-hero__sub">{{ heroSub }}</p>
        {%- endif %}

        <!-- Sketch: swirl, bottom left -->
        <div class="sketch-note sketch-float" aria-hidden="true" style="bottom: -10px; left: 2%; --sketch-rotate: -4deg;">
            <svg width="34" height="26" viewBox="0 0 34 26">
                <path d="M2 20 C2 10, 12 4, 20 8 C26 11, 25 20, 19 20 C14 20, 13 13, 18 12 C23 11, 28 15, 30 20" class="sketch-swirl"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Sketch: dots and zigzag, bottom right -->
        <div class="sketch-note" aria-hidden="true" style="bottom: -14px; right: 1%; transform: rotate(-6deg);">
            <svg width="46" height="28" viewBox="0 0 46 28">
                <path d="M2 20 L9 11 L16 20 L23 11 L30 20" class="sketch-zigzag"/>
                <circle cx="37" cy="12" r="2" class="sketch-dots"/>
                <circle cx="43" cy="19" r="1.5" class="sketch-dots" style="opacity: 0.2;"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
